[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2857874253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106131#issuecomment-2857874253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106131","id":2857874253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qV7NN","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-07T09:34:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-07T09:42:55Z","body":"You're connecting to signals just fine, but of a different LineEdit than you want. There's now an additional filter option (added in #88673).\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea46a838-fe36-46e4-825b-22f372f6b86f)\n\nSo (in v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]) you'd need to change:\n`var footer_container: HBoxContainer = body_container.get_child(3, true) as HBoxContainer`\nto:\n`var footer_container: HBoxContainer = body_container.get_child(4, true) as HBoxContainer`.\n\nNote you can use `Engine.get_version_info()` to customize your code based on the engine version.\n\nClosing as not a bug. Internal nodes are not guaranteed to be the same between the versions so if you're dealing with internal nodes then you need to ensure you're getting the correct ones.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2857874253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2858758263","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106131#issuecomment-2858758263","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106131","id":2858758263,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qZTB3","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-07T14:12:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-07T14:30:56Z","body":"ooohh my asserts didn't protect me from this change\n\n**EDIT:** for the record here is the fix to the issue as advetised :)\nhttps://github.com/MSEP-one/msep.one/pull/180","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comm